            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">This dataset represents the supply of 1 kilogram of hydrogen. The hydrogen is distributed by truck over 250 km to the regional storage (Geological cavity) and transported another 250 km to the consumer.  The hydrogen is produced by  Electrolysis, AEC, with electricity from grid as feedstock. Transmission loss [% output]: 0.03%. Regional storage loss [% output]: 0.69.  For more information, refer to: Sacchi, R. and Bauer, C. LCA of Power-to-X processes and applications in the residential sector. Paul Scherrer Institut, 2023. Source: Sacchi, R. and Bauer, C. LCA of Power-to-X processes and applications in the residential sector. Paul Scherrer Institut, 2023.

 UUID: 46df2466-c293-3a0b-865c-612e1b891d17</common:generalComment>
